% exam-minimal.sty
% Lean preamble for question papers: everything the paper needs and nothing more.
%   graphics, TikZ + tkz-euclide, \rupee, \doublespacing, microtype,
%   multicol/multirow/tables, and the exam.cls label + marks formatting.
% (v1.x duplicated sagar-exam-core and sagar-graphics; v2.0 just combines them.)
